# Dragon Magazine Compendium - alternative class features for classes of Complete Arcane (loaded only with it; acf_build.py).

Dead Levels	KEY:Warmage ACF ~ Dead Levels (DMC)	CATEGORY:ACF	COST:0	TYPE:ACF.WarmageACF.WarmageDeadLevels	PRECLASS:1,Warmage=2	ABILITY:Special Ability|AUTOMATIC|ACF ~ Warmage Dead Levels (DMC)	SOURCEPAGE:p.647	DESC:Alternative class feature (warmage, 2nd level). Evocation Sense (Ex), from 2nd level: the warmage recognizes the material, somatic and verbal components of evocation spells: +%1 on Spellcraft checks to identify an evocation spell being cast (+1 at 2nd level, +1 more at 4th, 5th, 9th, 12th, 13th, 14th, 17th, 18th and 19th). Replaces nothing.
Dead Levels	KEY:ACF ~ Warmage Dead Levels (DMC)	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Warmage Class Feature	SOURCEPAGE:p.647	DESC:Evocation Sense (Ex), from 2nd level: the warmage recognizes the material, somatic and verbal components of evocation spells: +%1 on Spellcraft checks to identify an evocation spell being cast (+1 at 2nd level, +1 more at 4th, 5th, 9th, 12th, 13th, 14th, 17th, 18th and 19th). Replaces nothing.|(var("CL=Warmage")>=2)+(var("CL=Warmage")>=4)+(var("CL=Warmage")>=5)+(var("CL=Warmage")>=9)+(var("CL=Warmage")>=12)+(var("CL=Warmage")>=13)+(var("CL=Warmage")>=14)+(var("CL=Warmage")>=17)+(var("CL=Warmage")>=18)+(var("CL=Warmage")>=19)
Eclectic Learning	KEY:Warmage ACF ~ Eclectic Learning (DMC)	CATEGORY:ACF	COST:0	TYPE:ACF.WarmageACF.WarmageAdvancedLearning	PRECLASS:1,Warmage=3	ABILITY:Special Ability|AUTOMATIC|ACF ~ Eclectic Learning (DMC)	SOURCEPAGE:p.648	DESC:Alternative class feature (warmage, 3rd level). At 3rd, 6th, 11th or 16th level (each chosen separately) you may add a sorcerer/wizard spell of any school to your list instead of the advanced learning spell of that level; it counts as one level higher (invisibility as a 3rd-level warmage spell), and you must be able to cast spells of its adjusted level. Choose spells that stay useful. Replaces advanced learning at the levels chosen (the warmage grants it without an ACF guard; by hand). (Player's Handbook II's repository entry is an unfinished stub.)
Eclectic Learning	KEY:ACF ~ Eclectic Learning (DMC)	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Warmage Class Feature	SOURCEPAGE:p.648	DESC:At 3rd, 6th, 11th or 16th level (each chosen separately) you may add a sorcerer/wizard spell of any school to your list instead of the advanced learning spell of that level; it counts as one level higher (invisibility as a 3rd-level warmage spell), and you must be able to cast spells of its adjusted level. Choose spells that stay useful. Replaces advanced learning at the levels chosen (the warmage grants it without an ACF guard; by hand). (Player's Handbook II's repository entry is an unfinished stub.)
Dead Levels	KEY:Wu Jen ACF ~ Dead Levels (DMC)	CATEGORY:ACF	COST:0	TYPE:ACF.Wu JenACF.WuJenDeadLevels	PRECLASS:1,Wu Jen=2	ABILITY:Special Ability|AUTOMATIC|ACF ~ Wu Jen Dead Levels (DMC)	SOURCEPAGE:p.702	DESC:Alternative class feature (wu jen, 2nd level). Intuitive Spirit, 2nd level: choose a Knowledge skill; once per day the wu jen can reroll a check with it before any information is disclosed, taking the better roll; from 4th level the reroll also serves Spellcraft checks to decipher or identify (not to learn or prepare spells), from 5th Concentration checks against distraction from nonmagical motion or weather. Elemental Bond (Ex), from 7th level: +%1 on Spellcraft checks to identify spells of his elemental mastery list being cast (+1 at 7th, +1 more at 8th, 10th, 11th, 13th, 14th, 16th, 17th, 19th and 20th). Replaces nothing.
Dead Levels	KEY:ACF ~ Wu Jen Dead Levels (DMC)	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Wu Jen Class Feature	SOURCEPAGE:p.702	DESC:Intuitive Spirit, 2nd level: choose a Knowledge skill; once per day the wu jen can reroll a check with it before any information is disclosed, taking the better roll; from 4th level the reroll also serves Spellcraft checks to decipher or identify (not to learn or prepare spells), from 5th Concentration checks against distraction from nonmagical motion or weather. Elemental Bond (Ex), from 7th level: +%1 on Spellcraft checks to identify spells of his elemental mastery list being cast (+1 at 7th, +1 more at 8th, 10th, 11th, 13th, 14th, 16th, 17th, 19th and 20th). Replaces nothing.|(var("CL=Wu Jen")>=7)+(var("CL=Wu Jen")>=8)+(var("CL=Wu Jen")>=10)+(var("CL=Wu Jen")>=11)+(var("CL=Wu Jen")>=13)+(var("CL=Wu Jen")>=14)+(var("CL=Wu Jen")>=16)+(var("CL=Wu Jen")>=17)+(var("CL=Wu Jen")>=19)+(var("CL=Wu Jen")>=20)
